ive cutting‑edge projects that shape the future of aerospace and advanced manufacturing. We’re looking for a proactive Project Manager who thrives in a collaborative, fast‑paced environment and enjoys turning complex ideas into successful, well‑executed outcomes. If you’re motivated by meaningful work, enjoy partnering with experts across disciplines, and want to be part of a mission-focused research organization, we’d love to hear from you. Custodial Lead Join a team that takes pride in maintaining a clean, safe, and welcoming environment for students, faculty, and staff.\n\nAs a Custodial Lead, you will play a vital role in the upkeep of our university facilities by performing specialized custodial services and ensuring the proper operation and maintenance of custodial equipment. And the best part? You’ll enjoy a robust benefits package effective on your first day, supporting your health, well-being, and future, because we believe in taking care of the people who take care of our campus. Custodial Supervisor, Second Shift Join a team that takes pride in maintaining a clean, safe, and welcoming environment for students, faculty, and staff.\n\nAs a Custodial Supervisor, you will play a vital role in the upkeep of our university facilities by performing specialized custodial services and ensuring the proper operation and maintenance of custodial equipment.\n\nAnd the best part? You’ll enjoy a robust benefits package effective on your first day, supporting your health, well-being, and future, because we believe in taking care of the people who take care of our campus. 1845 Fairmount St. Wichita , Kansas 67260 USA (316) 978-3456 Request Info Visit Apply Contact Us Virtual Tour Campus Map and Directions Facebook X | Twitter Instagram YouTube Linkedin People at Wichita State will make introductions, look for (applied learning) opportunities, and give advice that will put you miles ahead of others. Jon Peterson , senior in business administration and real estate finance A