23 items) 23 Strategic Enrollment (1 items) 1 Strategic Enrollment Mgmt (6 items) 6 Student Affairs (College) (6 items) 6 Women's Sports/Activities (2 items) 2 WSU Police Department (3 items) 3 Search by job title, location, department, category, etc. Search Sort by: Last Updated Last Updated: Newest to Oldest Last Updated: Oldest to Newest Title: A-Z Title: Z-A OAL Student Assistant 499557 Wichita Student Strategic Enrollment Mgmt We are looking for an undergraduate student to work about 10-20 hours a week. We put the emphasis on the student & ensure studies come first. Read more Director Support Services- Postal, Printing & Promo Solutions 499341 Wichita Management/Administration Staff Finance Administration (College) Some days you’ll be the face of the operation. Other days, you’ll be the person behind the curtain making sure everything works.\n\nYou’ll lead the daily operations of the department. We need someone who can look at the operation & evaluate:\nWhat’s working?\nWhat isn't?\nWhat do we need next?\nAnd how can we do this better? Read more NIAR 5-Axis CNC Machinist 499480 Wichita Aviation Staff NIAR Institute The National Institute for Aviation Research (NIAR) at Wichita State University is looking for an experienced Multi-Axis Machinist.  This position is located at the Advanced Machining and Prototyping (AMP) Lab in Park City, KS.  \nIf you are someone that takes pride in your work and will work to push the needle forward to meet customers' requirements, apply now!  Come join our fast-paced and fast-growing team! Read more Landscaper 498900 Wichita Facilities/Groundskeeping Staff Physical Plant Do you enjoy working outside? This Landscaper position provides opportunities to work outdoors as a member of a supportive team and have daily duties that vary according to University need. This position also comes with a robust benefits package (effective on your first day) and generous paid time off. Read more NIAR ATLAS Assistant Program Management 499584 Wichita Temporary NIAR Institute The NIAR ATLAS lab is looking for an assistant for their Program Management position. Read more NIAR ATLAS Graduate Assistant Program Management 499583 Wichita Student NIAR Institute The NIAR ATLAS lab is looking for a graduate assistant for their Program Management position. Read more NIAR ATLAS Student Assistant Program Management 497258 Wichita Student NIAR Institute The NIAR ATLAS lab is seeking a student assistant to assist with program management. Read more ESSC Student Assistant - Work Study 499542 Wichita Student College of Engineering Join the College of Engineering Student Success Center and help create meaningful experiences that connect students to the college and campus community. The Student Engineering Student Success Center will supports planning and executing programs, events, outreach, and engagement initiatives while gaining hands-on experience in event planning, marketing, social media, communication, and program administration. Read more AE Student Assistant - Work Study 499543 Wichita Student College of Engineering The Aerospace Engineering Department is seeking a reliable and professional Work-Study Student Assistant to provide front office support and assist with daily administrative operations. This role serves as a key point of contact for visitors, students, faculty, and staff. Read more NBE Lecturer WSU 0237L 499520 Wichita Adjunct Faculty/Lecturer Academic Affairs Direct Instructor for WSU's Lifelong Learning program. Read more NIAR Composites and Structures Student Assistant 496720 Wichita Student NIAR Institute The NIAR Composites & Structures Lab is looking for a student assistant to do a variety of different tasks within their lab. Read more NBE Student Assistant WSU 0350R 499512 Wichita Student College of Education The Student Assistant will support ongoing research projects related to special education, teacher education, motivation, and psychological well-being. The student will assist with a range of research-related tasks under faculty supervision. Read more Employee Relations Specialist- HR 499409 Wichita Staff Culture and HR Workplace challenges are rarely black and white. We’re looking for an experienced Employee Relations/HR professional who can navigate complex situations with curiosity, sound judgment, and a commitment to fairness. Read more NIAR CNC Machinist II - ATLAS 499550 Wichita Aviation Staff NIAR Institute Join the NIAR ATLAS team and play a key role in shaping precision manufacturing at Wichita State University. We’re looking for a skilled CNC Machinist who enjoys hands-on work, solving problems, and transforming detailed technical designs into exact, high‑quality components. If you thrive in an environment where craftsmanship, accuracy, and continuous improvement are valued, this full-time, on-site role offers the opportunity to grow your expertise while contributing to innovative research and production. Read more Community Program Coordinator 499108 Wichita Office/Administrative Support Staff Strategic Engagement & Planning Are you an organized multitasker who thrives on bringing people, projects, and ideas together? Do you enjoy researching solutions, analyzing information, engaging with community partners, and helping meaningful initiatives move from concept to completion? If so, we want to hear from you. Read more ISME Student Assistant - Work Study 499539 Wichita Student College of Engineering Industrial, Systems, and Manufacturing Engineering (ISME) department is seeking reliable and professional Work-Study Student Assistants to provide front office support and assist with daily administrative operations. This role serves as a key point of contact for visitors, students, faculty, and staff. Read more Tutor 499537 Wichita Temporary Strategic Engagement & Planning We're seeking enthusiastic, responsible, and compassionate individuals to join our team as Tutors. In this role, you'll do more than help with homework - you'll mentor young minds, support their growth, and make a real impact in their lives. Read more NIAR CNC Machinist I - ATLAS 499545 Wichita Staff NIAR Institute Join the NIAR ATLAS team and play a key role in shaping precision manufacturing at Wichita State University. We’re looking for a skilled CNC Machinist who enjoys hands-on work, solving problems, and transforming detailed technical designs into exact, high‑quality components. If you thrive in an environment where craftsmanship, accuracy, and continuous improvement are valued, this full-time, on-site role offers the opportunity to grow your expertise while contributing to innovative research and production. Read more NBE Student Assistant WSU 0350R 499536 Wichita Student College of Liberal Arts & Sciences The Anthropology Student Assistant provides administrative, academic, and operational support to faculty, staff, and students within the Department of Anthropology. This position offers students an opportunity to gain professional experience in higher education while contributing to the daily functions of the department. Duties may include research or clerical duties to include data collection, management, laboratory or office operations, event assistance, data entry, and support for departmental projects and activities. Student assistants will be directly supervised by a faculty member in the Department of Anthropology. Read more NBE Student Assistant WSU 0350R 499538 Wichita Student College of Engineering Industrial, Systems, and Manufacturing Engineering (ISME) department is seeking reliable and professional Student Assistants to provide front office support and assist with daily administrative operations. This role serves as a key point of contact for visitors, students, faculty, and staff. Read more NIAR ATLAS SCRAM Student Assistant 499023 Wichita Student NIAR Institute The NIAR ATLAS lab is looking for a SCRAM student assistant. Read more Student Assistant 499540 Wichita Student WSU Police Department Primary responsibility is to assist with parking office duties and provide mobility assistance transportation for Parking & Transportation Services. This role involves front office tasks, customer service, cash handling, and providing rides on golf carts. Read more Applied Learning OAL Communication Intern 499477 Wichita Student Academic Affairs Departments Are you passionate about storytelling, content creation, and connecting people through communication? The Online and Adult Learning Communications Intern will help share the stories, achievements, and experiences of online and adult learners at Wichita State University through writing, digital content, and community engagement initiatives. Read more OAL Parent & Caregiver  Applied Learning Programming Intern WSU 499476 Wichita Student Academic Affairs Departments Are you passionate about supporting students, building community, and creating meaningful programs? The Parents and Caregivers Community (PACC) Programming Intern will help develop and deliver initiatives that support Wichita State students who are balancing their education with parenting and caregiving responsibilities. Read more NIAR Liaison Engineer - Sustainment 499195 Wichita Aviation Staff NIAR Institute NIAR Sustainment is hiring a full-time engineering liaison to support customer communication, interpret technical data, and provide recommendations based on inspection results. This role prepares technical reports, supports root cause analysis, and participates in technical discussions. U.S. citizenship is required due to export-controlled work. Work is performed onsite in our Park City location. Read more Advanced Materials and Manufacturing Research Assistant 496164 Wichita Temporary NIAR Institute The Advanced Materials and Manufacturing group at the National Institute for Aviation Research (NIAR) is seeking an engineering or related field student for a year round internship located in our downtown Huntsville, Alabama office. This role is designed to support an applied learning atmosphere while the student continues working toward their undergraduate or graduate degree.\nWe are looking for candidates with an interest in metallic and polymer additive manufacturing, high temperature composite materials, or software development and databasing. This position supports all aspects of applied research for a variety of government and industry customers.\nProject work will typically involve the characterization, qualification, and integration of newly emerging materials and manufacturing processes into both current and next generation systems. The types of evaluation will involve a wide range of systems such as ground vehicles, aircraft, and missile. Evaluations may also include thermo-structural modeling and studies related to material decomposition in high-temperature environments.\nThis position will be based entirely in Huntsville, AL, and will see you work closely with engineers at NIAR to support our growing government and industry customer base. If you are detail-oriented, enjoy challenging and rewarding work, and like being part of a team, consider applying for this position. Read more Financial Aid Communications Intern - Applied Learning 499414 Wichita Student Academic Affairs Departments When students are seeking clear, accessible information about financial aid and scholarships, our office needs creative communicators who can craft messages that truly matter. We’re hiring two Communications Interns for the 2026-2027 academic year to help us connect with diverse audiences and make financial aid resources easier to understand. Read more Financial Aid Scholar Retention Intern - Applied Learning 499485 Wichita Student Academic Affairs Departments The Scholar Retention Intern will support scholars by collecting data, identifying gaps in student success, and coordinating communication timelines that help students stay on track to persist and graduate. We are seeking a detail‑oriented, compassionate, energetic, and creative intern who can manage small projects, organize outreach cycles, and think outside the box to strengthen scholar engagement. Read more WSU Temp - Plant Ecology Crew Lead 498442 Wichita Temporary College of Liberal Arts & Sciences Wichita State University is seeking up to five highly motivated technicians to assist in data collection for a collaborative research project investigating the response of plants, birds, and soils to different cattle grazing practices on Conservation Reserve Program (CRP) grasslands in Kansas and Colorado. Although grazing animals such as bison historically played an important role in native prairie, grazing is currently excluded or highly limited in many CRP sites related to native prairie. Our study will quantify potential conservation risks and benefits of cattle grazing on CRP sites located in tallgrass (Kansas) and shortgrass (Colorado) Read more WSU Temp - Plant Ecology Technician 498428 Wichita Temporary College of Liberal Arts & Sciences Wichita State University is seeking up to five highly motivated technicians to assist in data collection for a collaborative research project investigating the response of plants, birds, and soils to different cattle grazing practices on Conservation Reserve Program (CRP) grasslands in Kansas and Colorado. Although grazing animals such as bison historically played an important role in native prairie, grazing is currently excluded or highly limited in many CRP sites related to native prairie. Our study will quantify potential conservation risks and benefits of cattle grazing on CRP sites located in tallgrass (Kansas) and shortgrass (Colorado). Read more Displaying 31 - 60 of 197 in total ‹ 1 2 3 4 5 6 7 › 1845 Fairmount St. Wichita , Kansas 67260 USA (316) 978-3456 Request Info Visit Apply Contact Us Virtual Tour Campus Map and Directions Facebook X | Twitter Instagram YouTube Linkedin People at Wichita State will make introductions, look for (applied learning) opportunities, and give advice that will put you