23 items) 23 Strategic Enrollment (1 items) 1 Strategic Enrollment Mgmt (6 items) 6 Student Affairs (College) (6 items) 6 Women's Sports/Activities (2 items) 2 WSU Police Department (3 items) 3 Search by job title, location, department, category, etc. Search Sort by: Last Updated Last Updated: Newest to Oldest Last Updated: Oldest to Newest Title: A-Z Title: Z-A Summer Program Aide - Temporary 498515 Wichita Temporary Strategic Engagement & Planning We're seeking enthusiastic, responsible, and compassionate individuals to join our team as Tutors. In this role, you'll do more than help with homework - you'll mentor young minds, support their growth, and make a real impact in their lives. Read more WSU Athletics General Event Staff 498520 Wichita Temporary Women's Sports/Activities Wichita State Intercollegiate Athletic Association, Inc, is searching for professional, service-focused individuals for Event Staff for Charles Koch Arena, Eck Stadium, Wilkins and Cessna Stadium.\nEvent Staff is responsible for crowd management and executing Arena, Stadium and WSU-ICAA event policies and procedures. Positions include but aren't limited to ticket taker, security, and parking staff. We deliver memorable experiences that connect all to Shocker Nation Through a Shared Sense of Pride & Passion. Read more NBE Student Assistant WSU 0350R 499507 Wichita Student Academic Programs Are you a Military-Connected student looking for a flexible part-time position? The WSU at McConnell Campus is looking for a knowledgeable, reliable student assistant who understands the military community to join our team! This position offers flexible hours and a positive, safe environment to engage, create, and grow your skills.\nAs a student assistant for the WSU McConnell office, located on McConnell Air Force Base (AFB), you will provide day-to-day administrative, operational, and clerical support to the Military Education Specialist. Helping to deliver a professional and welcoming environment for servicemembers, military families, AFB employees, education services staff, students, and WSU faculty. You will have the opportunity to engage with a diverse population through everyday tasks, events, and outreach by helping them find resources and support to successfully navigate higher education and fulfill their academic goals! Read more NBE Student Assistant WSU 0350R 499493 Wichita Student Barton School of Business We are seeking a motivated student for a position with a focus on supporting marketing activities. Read more Independent School Tech Support Student Assistant 495860 Wichita Student Natl Inst for Rsrch&Digtal Transfrm Ennovar is looking for a student to provide The Independent School with Level 1 and Level 2 Technical Assistance Support. Read more Independent School Tech Support 495861 Wichita Temporary Natl Inst for Rsrch&Digtal Transfrm Ennovar is looking for a student to provide The Independent School with Level 1 and Level 2 Technical Assistance Support. Read more Textron Aviation Help Desk Analyst I 495389 Wichita Student Natl Inst for Rsrch&Digtal Transfrm The IT Support will be working in multiple areas of software and hardware. The ideal candidate will be someone who can provide in-person/face-to-face and/or remote end-user Windows PC support services at our Enterprise Customers site. Supported services include software break-fix/remediation, Installation, Move, Add, & Change on end-user hardware and software. Read more NIAR Executive Assistant 499497 Wichita Aviation Staff NIAR Institute The Administrative Professional plays a vital role in supporting senior leadership within NIAR Sustainment by ensuring seamless coordination of daily operations and strategic activities. This position manages complex calendars, organizes high‑level meetings and events, arranges domestic and international travel, and prepares clear, well‑crafted correspondence, presentations, and reports that support informed decision‑making. Read more NBE Student Assistant WSU 0350R 499483 Wichita Student Strategic Engagement & Planning The ideal candidate is a creative and motivated student with an interest in branding, social media, graphic design, and strategic communication. They should have some experience creating engaging digital content and an interest in learning how to develop cohesive communication campaigns from idea to execution. We’re looking for a student who brings fresh ideas, stays curious about current communication and social media trends, and is excited to apply what they are learning in a real-world setting. Most importantly, the ideal candidate will bring curiosity, initiative, creativity, a willingness to learn, and a passion for using communication to make a meaningful impact. Read more Commencement & Events Coordinator 498431 Wichita Staff Academic Affairs Direct Wichita State University is seeking a highly organized and detail-oriented Commencement & Events Coordinator to join our team of event professionals. This position will plan, coordinate, and execute commencement ceremonies and other University events for WSU campus and community. This role plays a critical part in ensuring high-quality experiences by coordinating logistics, facilities, services, and on-site operations. Read more Digital and Video Producer 499268 Wichita Academic/Student Support Management/Administration Office/Administrative Support Staff Show More Show Less Strategic Communications Are you a creative storyteller who thrives behind the camera, in the editing suite and at the design desk? Wichita State University is seeking a talented Digital and Video Producer to help bring the university’s stories to life through compelling visual content.\nAs part of the Office of Strategic Communications and Marketing, this hybrid creative role will produce high-quality video content and support a wide range of visual design initiatives that enhance the university’s brand and engage diverse audiences. Reporting to the Director of Videography, the successful candidate will collaborate with campus partners to create content that informs, inspires and connects the Wichita State community. Read more Peer Mentor - TRIO Student Support Services 499292 Wichita Student Strategic Engagement & Planning Are you passionate about supporting your fellow students and making a meaningful impact on campus? As a peer mentor in TRIO Student Support Services, you will play a key role in helping first-generation, limited-income students, and students with disabilities overcome challenges and achieve their goals. This position is an opportunity to guide, support, and uplift your peers as they navigate college life. If you are dedicated to building an inclusive community, offering encouragement, and sharing valuable insights, we encourage you to apply and be part of a team committed to student success! Read more Placement and Office Coordinator 499293 Wichita Staff College of Education If you enjoy building relationships, keeping complex processes organized, and helping students succeed, this role offers an opportunity to make a meaningful impact on the preparation of future educators.\n\nAs the Placement and Office Coordinator in the College of Education, you will serve as a central connection between students, faculty, school district partners, and university staff to ensure high-quality field and clinical experiences. You will coordinate educational placements, monitor student readiness and compliance with program requirements, and help ensure that accreditation standards, university policies, and partnership agreements are met.\n\nSuccess in this position requires someone who is highly organized, proactive, and detail oriented. You will communicate regularly with students, faculty, and external partners, identify opportunities to strengthen placement processes and services, and help maintain strong relationships with school districts and community partners. Your work will directly contribute to creating meaningful experiential learning opportunities for future educators. Read more ITRM/IAM Security Analyst 496679 Wichita Temporary Natl Inst for Rsrch&Digtal Transfrm Ennovar is looking for an assistant to help with security development at Textron Aviation. Read more ITRM/IAM Security Analyst Student Assistant 496677 Wichita Student Natl Inst for Rsrch&Digtal Transfrm Ennovar is looking for a student assistant to help with security development at Textron Aviation. Read more Applied Learning College Access Coach 499302 Wichita Student Strategic Enrollment his position will work with various college and career centers at local high schools to assist students with the college search process. The goal of the coach position is to help high school students feel informed about their future decisions, wherever that next step might be. Read more Emergent Leadership Student Assistant - Applied Learning 499274 Wichita Student Academic Affairs Departments Looking to strengthen your leadership expertise while in college?\nWe are seeking a Shocker who is interested in developing their skills to emerge as a confident and committed leader through a paid applied learning student position. This opportunity is to help you gain hands-on experience in a challenging, diverse career environment while working in an educational service setting at McConnell Air Force Base. You will assist the Military Education Specialist in connecting, engaging, supporting, and helping military-connected members while further developing and utilizing your leadership skills at the WSU at McConnell Campus. Exemplify leadership through informed, professional, and courteous engagement. Dr. Mark Vermillion, Chair of the Sport & Leadership Studies Department, will ensure that this position provides meaningful, real-world experiences that directly align with your academic preparation and professional goals. Read more Graphic Design Intern for OAL Applied Learning WSU 0350R 499182 Wichita Student Academic Affairs Departments The applied learning experience will include brand-aligned design, visual storytelling, digital asset creation, and print-ready production. These responsibilities serve as a proving ground where the student applies foundational design principles—layout, typography, color theory, accessibility, and visual hierarchy—while learning to work with real constraints, timelines, and stakeholders. This experience also supports interdisciplinary application by connecting design practice to communication strategy, student engagement, and retention-focused initiatives. Read more IDP Technology HelpDesk Specialist 499415 Wichita Information Technology Staff Office Ind & Defense Administration Join the IDP Information Technology Center at Wichita State University and help empower students and staff with reliable, high‑quality technology support. In this hands‑on role, you’ll be the go‑to problem solver for end‑user devices, ensuring our campus community stays productive and connected. If you’re passionate about troubleshooting, enjoy helping others, and are ready to grow your IT career in a dynamic environment, we’d love to meet you. Read more Performance Facilities Applied Learning Assistant 499014 Wichita Student College of Fine Arts Performance Facilities, part of the College of Fine Arts, manages performance venues including Miller Concert Hall, Wiedemann Hall, DFAC Outdoor Amphitheatre, Wilner Auditorium, and Welsbacher Theatre. These spaces support music and performing arts events, as well as campus and community group performances. The department also provides technical support (audio, lighting, staging) for events at venues like Lowe Auditorium, CAC Theater, Koch Arena, and WSU Commencement. Read more NBE WSU Temp - Hourly U3 6998T 499420 Wichita Temporary Strategic Engagement & Planning Wichita GEAR UP South/West program serving students in grades 6-12 and first year in college.\nThis is NOT a remote position - check the job location before applying! Read more NIAR Composites and Structures Non-Destructive Inspection Student Assistant 499449 Wichita Student NIAR Institute The NIAR Composites & Structures lab is looking for a Non Destructive Inspection Student Assistant. Read more Integra Technologies Software Engineer Student Assistant 498164 Wichita Student Natl Inst for Rsrch&Digtal Transfrm Ennovar is looking for a student assistant software engineer to work at Integra Technologies. Read more NBE Graduate Assistant 0310G 499400 Wichita Student Information Technology Join Our WSU Technology Help Desk Team!\nAre you a Graduate Student passionate about technology and helping others? The Tech Help Desk is seeking a dedicated individual to provide top-notch technical support to our community. As a member of our Technology Help Desk team, you will:\n• Assist with system access, wireless networks, email, University websites, and more.\n• Support students with personal devices, ensuring they stay connected and productive in a student-centered center.\n• Offer comprehensive services for WSU client computers via phone, email, and online ticketing.\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Assist with password resets and troubleshoot general access issues.\n• Create and manage tickets for servicing University-licensed software and hardware.\n• Collaborate closely with other teams, including Desktop Support, Windows Server Group, Network Support, and Telecom.\nWhy Join Us?\n• Customer satisfaction is our top priority. You'll play a crucial role in meeting our community's tech needs.\n• Team-oriented environment. Work alongside skilled professionals and gain valuable experience.\n• Benefits. You will receive in-state tuition while in this position and be paid 20 hours a week.\nIf you're ready to make a difference and help our WSU Technology Help Desk thrive, apply today! Read more NBE Graduate Assistant 0310G 499398 Wichita Student Strategic Engagement & Planning The Public Policy and Management Center (PPMC) at Wichita State University is looking for a Graduate Student Assistant to support the Talent & Professional Services team. The PPMC organizes many recurring (annual) and one-time public service events/conferences for clients across the state including (but not limited to):\n\n• Kansas County Clerks and Election Officials Association,\n• City Clerks and Municipal Finance Officers Association (CCMFOA)\n• Kansas Government Finance Officers Association\n• Kansas Museums Association\n• State of KS Department of Commerce\n• Sedgwick County\n• City of Wichita\n\nThe ideal candidate for this position is proactive, detail oriented, organized, and a collaborative worker. This role is a good opportunity for students interested in developing customer service skills and event/project coordination skills. Read more NBE Student Assistant WSU 0350R 499395 Wichita Student Strategic Engagement & Planning A student assistant will carry out administrative and technical tasks requested by a supervisor. Depending on the area the student assistant is employed in, they may assist and mentor other students or provide support throughout the campus in various forms. Read more Paper Grader-Abdelbaset Zeyani 499353 Wichita Student College of Liberal Arts & Sciences Are you a detail-oriented student with a strong background in mathematics and/or statistics, and the ability to work independently on assigned tasks? The Mathematics and Statistics department is seeking qualified student paper graders for the fall semester 2027. Read more NIAR Program Manager - ATLAS 499441 Wichita Aviation Staff NIAR Institute ATLAS is looking for a Program Manager with a good understanding of material and process specifications, manufacturing techniques, and certification and qualification testing for advanced composites materials. Read more NIAR CAD/CAM Business Analytics Student Assistant 499312 Wichita Student NIAR Institute The NIAR CAD/CAM lab is looking for a Business Analytics student assistant. Read more IDP Information Security Analyst 499416 Wichita Information Technology Staff Office Ind & Defense Administration WSU IDP is currently searching for a Cybersecurity Analyst to assist with NIAR’s Security Helpdesk and Operations Center (SHOC). The SHOC is responsible for monitoring and safeguarding the organization’s systems and data, as well as enforcing cybersecurity industry best practices and compliance with NIST 800-171. The SHOC also plays a support and collaborative role with other WSU InfoSec teams. Read more Displaying 61 - 90 of 197 in total ‹ 1 2 3 4 5 6 7 › 1845 Fairmount St. Wichita , Kansas 67260 USA (316) 978-3456 Request Info Visit Apply Contact Us Virtual Tour Campus Map and Directions Facebook X | Twitter Instagram YouTube Linkedin People at Wichita State will make introductions, look for (applied learning) opportunities, and give advice that will put you miles ahead of others. Jon Peterson , senior in business administration and real estate finance Alumni & Friends Give to WSU A-Z Index Freedom of Expression Policies and Procedures Privacy Policy Notice of Nondiscrimination Title IX Campus Safety Accessibility Public Information Website Support KBOR Freedom of Expression Statement HLC Accreditation © 2024 Wichita State University Wichita State University (\"WSU\") does not discriminate on the basis of sex in its education programs, activities, admissions and employment. Candidate Details We use \"cookies\" on this site. A cookie is a piece of data stored on a site visitor's hard drive to help us improve your access to our site and identify repeat visitors to our site. For instance, when we use a cookie to identify you, you would not have to log in a password more than once, thereby saving time while on our site. Cookies can also enable us to track and target the interests of our users to enhance the experience on our site. Usage of a cookie is in no way linked to any personally identifiable information on our site. Some of our business partners may use cookies on our site (for example, Google Analytics). However, 