23 items) 23 Strategic Enrollment (1 items) 1 Strategic Enrollment Mgmt (6 items) 6 Student Affairs (College) (6 items) 6 Women's Sports/Activities (2 items) 2 WSU Police Department (3 items) 3 Search by job title, location, department, category, etc. Search Sort by: Last Updated Last Updated: Newest to Oldest Last Updated: Oldest to Newest Title: A-Z Title: Z-A Student Assistant 499264 Wichita Student Student Affairs (College) This position provides office support of the general, day-to-day administrative, operational and clerical tasks related to the office.\nProvide a professional, helpful, welcoming atmosphere and a positive attitude for faculty, staff, students, families, callers and visitors of the Office of the Vice President for Student Affairs. Provide coverage for the front desk including answering phones, transfer calls, take messages; send and receive faxes, e-mails on behalf of the staff Receive and process department paperwork. Assist with projects as required (i.e. prepare materials for distribution, create spreadsheets, event set-up, etc.) Assist Vice President, Associate Vice President, Assistant Vice President, Executive Assistant and other staff as requested. Maintain office inventory. Run errands across campus to deliver documents and materials. Provide service excellence through courteous, informed, accessible and professional engagement. Perform other duties as assigned. Read more Web Manager/Lead Tutor TRIO SSS 499144 Wichita Student Strategic Engagement & Planning Are you passionate about helping students reach their academic potential while applying your technical and leadership skills? TRIO Student Support Services (SSS) is seeking a Web Manager/Lead Tutor to join our team! Read more NBE Student Assistant WSU 0350R 499177 Wichita Student Strategic Enrollment Mgmt We are looking for an undergraduate student to work approximately 10-20 hours a week. We put the emphasis on the student & ensure studies come first. Read more Student Assistant at WSU Old Town - FWS 499166 Wichita Student Academic Programs A student assistant will carry out administrative and technical tasks requested by a supervisor. Depending on the area the student assistant is employed in, they may assist and mentor other students or provide support throughout the campus in various forms. Read more NBE WSU Temp 499149 Wichita Temporary Strategic Engagement & Planning Veteran Student Support Services (VSSS), a federally funded TRIO program at Wichita State University, is seeking a highly organized, customer-focused Administrative Assistant to support the daily operations of the program. This position serves as the first point of contact for students, faculty, staff, and community partners while providing administrative, clerical, and light database support that contributes to the success of military-connected students.\n\nThe ideal candidate is detail-oriented, dependable, and enjoys working in a collaborative, student-centered environment. This position plays an important role in maintaining accurate student records, supporting program events, and ensuring compliance with federal reporting requirements. Read more NIAR CONSULTANT - Senior Design Engineer- Systems 498554 Temporary NIAR Institute NIAR is looking for a talented Senior Systems Design Engineer- Mechanical / EWIS / Interior to join our growing, innovative team. System design activity includes flight test, instrumentation, mechanical systems, electrical systems, interiors, and special mission systems. This position will be an independent contractor consulting as a Senior Systems Design Engineer- Mechanical / EWIS / Interior with NIAR to support various diverse customer programs. Read more NIAR Statistician 499226 Wichita Aviation Staff NIAR Institute The Composites and Structures Lab is looking for a Statistician to join their team. If you are detail oriented, enjoy challenging and rewarding work, and like being part of a team, consider applying for this position! Read more NIAR Instrumentation Technician - Full Scale Structural Test 499142 Wichita Aviation Staff NIAR Institute NIAR’s Full Scale Structural Test team is seeking a skilled technician to support hands-on installation, calibration, maintenance, and repair of laboratory and test equipment. This onsite role plays a key part in ensuring safe, accurate, and reliable testing operations while assisting with troubleshooting, analytical measurements, procedural documentation, and student supervision. Read more NIAR Machine Technician - ATLAS 499055 Wichita Aviation Staff NIAR Institute Join the NIAR Advanced Technologies Lab for Aerospace Systems as an AFP/CNC Machinist on our second shift team. In this role, you’ll operate advanced automated fiber placement and CNC machining equipment to produce high‑precision aerospace components. You’ll handle machine setup, program verification, composite layup, troubleshooting, and quality checks in a fast‑paced, research‑driven environment. Ideal candidates bring CNC machining experience, strong attention to detail, and the ability to work from complex technical instructions. This position requires U.S. Person status due to export compliance regulations. Read more WSU Athletics General Student Event Staff 497963 Wichita Athletics Student Women's Sports/Activities A student assistant will carry out administrative and technical tasks requested by a supervisor. Depending on the area the student assistant is employed in, they may assist and mentor other students or provide support throughout the campus in various forms. Read more NIAR Research Engineer - Advanced Materials Research 499150 Wichita Aviation Staff NIAR Institute The Advanced Materials Research group is looking for a Research Engineer to support high temperature materials development, testing, and characterization activities for both external and internal flow for high-speed applications. This role will contribute to research programs involving thermal protection systems, aerothermal environments, high enthalpy testing, and material response under extreme conditions. This position is ideal for candidates with a strong background in materials science, aerospace engineering, mechanical engineering, and chemical engineering. Read more ATLAS Machining Lab Assistant 496571 Wichita Student NIAR Institute The NIAR ATLAS lab is looking for a student assistant to help with daily tasks within the lab. Read more IDP Contracts Specialist II 498292 Wichita Staff Office Ind & Defense Administration The ideal candidate for this position will possess significant experience in contract management, possess strong organizational skills, and will have a deep understanding of contract compliance. In this role you will work closely with the Director of IDP Contracts and Grants as you draft, review, redline and negotiate a broad range of simple and complex contracts that align with university objectives. This position will require strong negotiation skills, a comprehensive understanding of contract terms and strong attention to detail. Read more IDP Contracts Specialist I 498291 Wichita Staff Office Ind & Defense Administration The ideal candidate for this position will possess significant experience in contract management, possess strong organizational skills, and will have a deep understanding of contract compliance. In this role you will work closely with the Director of IDP Contracts and Grants as you draft, review, redline and negotiate a broad range of simple and complex contracts that align with university objectives. This position will require strong negotiation skills, a comprehensive understanding of contract terms and strong attention to detail. Read more Student Assistant WSU 499105 Wichita Student Student Affairs (College) A student assistant will carry out administrative and technical tasks requested by a supervisor. Depending on the area the student assistant is employed in, they may assist and mentor other students or provide support throughout the campus in various forms. Read more Director of Finance and Administration, Barton School of Business 498618 Wichita Management/Administration Staff Barton School of Business A new program is proposed. A center wants to grow. A donor wants to fund an idea. A department needs support.\nBefore Barton can decide what to do, someone has to make the numbers clear.\n\nAt the W. Frank Barton School of Business, the Director of Finance and Administration plays that role. This position sits close to the choices that shape the School’s direction. Read more Graduate Teaching Assistant 499096 Wichita Student College of Liberal Arts & Sciences The primary function of a graduate teaching assistant (GTA) is to provide direct instruction. GTAs have the latitude to make independent decisions, use judgment and exercise discretion when dealing with student matters. In either case, the main purpose and responsibility of GTAs is to impart knowledge or training to students at Wichita State University. Read more Textron Corporate Infrastructure Analyst Student Assistant 499093 Wichita Student Natl Inst for Rsrch&Digtal Transfrm Ennovar is looking for a student assistant to be an Infrastructure Analyst at Textron Aviation. Read more Research Economist - Center for Economic Development and Business Research (CEDBR) 499083 Wichita Aviation Finance Management/Administration Office/Administrative Support Staff Show More Show Less Barton School of Business The Center for Economic Development and Business Research (CEDBR) at WSU seeks a collaborative and client-focused Research Economist to support applied economic research and community engagement initiatives.\nThis is a front-facing role, someone who is able to work closely with businesses, government agencies, and community partners to lead projects from initial intake and scoping through final delivery. Read more NIAR ATLAS Student Assistant - Slitter 496732 Wichita Student NIAR Institute The NAIR ATLAS Lab is looking for a student assistant to help with a variety of tasks within their lab. Read more IDP Security Engineer - Ennovar 499080 Wichita Aviation Staff Natl Inst for Rsrch&Digtal Transfrm We are seeking a self-driven, highly motivated, hands-on IT Security Engineer to serve as a subject-matter expert (SME)/technical lead on our cybersecurity operations team. This individual contributor role focuses on operational excellence and maturity for different cyber operations processes, automation alignment, internal audit readiness (e.g., internal & external audits, including CMMC), and mentorship. The SME will work on-site, collaborating with junior staff, student contractors, and technical teams, while interfacing with non-IT stakeholders to support secure, scalable cybersecurity operations. Read more Tutor/Student Assistant - Disability Support Services 499072 Wichita Student Strategic Engagement & Planning A student assistant will carry out administrative and technical tasks requested by a supervisor. Depending on the area the student assistant is employed in, they may assist and mentor other students or provide support throughout the campus in various forms. Read more Student Assistant 498968 Wichita Student Student Affairs (College) A student assistant will carry out administrative and technical tasks requested by a supervisor. Depending on the area the student assistant is employed in, they may assist and mentor other students or provide support throughout the campus in various forms. Read more NIAR CONSULTANT - Senior Loads Engineer 499068 Aviation Temporary NIAR Institute This role provides senior-level leadership for an external loads engineering group, functioning as an independent contractor responsible for guiding the team through the development of aircraft-level load cases and documentation required for program milestones. This position emphasizes technical direction, coordination of team activities, and mentoring of engineers at varying experience levels.  Some travel may be required. Read more Public Health Program Specialist 498908 Wichita Staff Strategic Engagement & Planning If you are passionate about public health and ready to make a meaningful impact across Kansas communities, we want to hear from you!\nThis position offers the opportunity to work on impactful initiatives that improve the health and quality of life of Kansans while helping shape the future of public health in Kansas. Read more University Police Officer 498912 Wichita Staff WSU Police Department Are you interested in a career in law enforcement? Wichita State University is seeking to fill the position of University Police Officer. No previous law enforcement experience is required. Successful candidates will be required to complete the basic law enforcement training program at the Kansas Law Enforcement Training Center, obtain certification as a law enforcement officer from the Kansas Peace Officers’ Standards and Training Commission and successfully complete the WSU Police FTO (Field Training Officer) Program. Read more NIAR ATLAS AFP Student Assistant 498454 Wichita Student NIAR Institute The NIAR ATLAS lab is looking for a student assistant. Read more Textron SAP Developer 497850 Wichita Temporary Natl Inst for Rsrch&Digtal Transfrm Ennovar is seeking an SAP developer to work on-site at Textron Read more Lecturer WSU 498960 Wichita Adjunct Faculty/Lecturer College of Health Professions The lecturer's responsibilities include developing course material and curricula, inspiring meaningful discussions, attending conferences, consulting with other academics and professionals, supervising graduate students, grading assignments, and being an active member of the university. Read more Lecturer WSU 498958 Wichita Adjunct Faculty/Lecturer College of Health Professions The lecturer's responsibilities include developing course material and curricula, inspiring meaningful discussions, attending conferences, consulting with other academics and professionals, supervising graduate students, grading assignments, and being an active member of the university. Read more Displaying 121 - 150 of 197 in total ‹ 1 2 3 4 5 6 7 › 1845 Fairmount St. Wichita , Kansas 67260 USA (316) 978-3456 Request Info Visit Apply Contact Us Virtual Tour Campus Map and Directions Facebook X | Twitter Instagram YouTube Linkedin People at Wichita State will make introductions, look for (applied learning) opportunities, and give advice that will put you miles ahead of others. Jon Peterson , senior in business administration and real estate finance Alumni & Friends Give to WSU A-Z Index Freedom of Expression Policies and Procedures Privacy Policy Notice of Nondiscrimination Title IX Campus Safety Accessibility Public Information Website Support KBOR Freedom of Expression Statement HLC Accreditation © 2024 Wichita State University Wichita State University (\"WSU\") does not discriminate on the basis of sex in its education programs, activities, admissions and employment. Candidate Details We use \"cookies\" on this site. A cookie is a piece of data stored on a site visitor's hard drive to help us improve your access to our site and identify repeat visitors to our site. For instance, when we use a cookie to identify you, you would not have to log in a password more than once, thereby saving time while on our site. Cookies can also enable us to track and target the interests of our users to enhance the experience on our site. Usage of a cookie is in no way linked to any personally identifiable information on our site. Some of our business partners may use cookies on our site (for example, Google Analytics). However, we have no access to or control over these cookies. I do not accept I accept"
