      "description": "All Jobs Search Page social--blog Leadership Innovation at WSU Research Directories Give to WSU myWSU OneStop Quick Links Close Menu Close Menu Careers Faculty Staff Internal Why Wichita State University View\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tAll Jobs My Profile Leadership Innovation at WSU Research Directories Give to WSU myWSU OneStop Academic Calendar Apply Now! A-Z Directory Blackboard Calendar of Events Office Hours Policies and Procedures Schedule of Courses Shocker Store Student Webmail Technology HelpDesk Transfer to WSU University Libraries Close Menu Careers Faculty Staff Internal View All Jobs My Profile Kiosk mode Skip to jobs search results Clear Filters Category Search categories 12 filter options found Category Academic/Student Support (5 items) 5 Adjunct Faculty/Lecturer (5 items) 5 Athletics (4 items) 4 Aviation (36 items) 36 Facilities/Groundskeeping (1 items) 1 Finance (1 items) 1 Information Technology (3 items) 3 Management/Administration (6 items) 6 Office/Administrative Support (5 items) 5 Staff (68 items) 68 Student (93 items) 93 Temporary (33 items) 33 Department(s) Search 28 filter options found Department(s) Academic Affairs Departments (6 items) 6 Academic Affairs Direct (2 items) 2 Academic Programs (2 items) 2 Administrative and Support (4 items) 4 Barton School of Business (4 items) 4 Cohens Honors College (1 items) 1 College of Education (2 items) 2 College of Engineering (6 items) 6 College of Fine Arts (4 items) 4 College of Health Professions (3 items) 3 College of Liberal Arts & Sciences (7 items) 7 Culture and HR (2 items) 2 Finance Administration (College) (1 items) 1 FirePoint Innovations (1 items) 1 Information Technology (3 items) 3 Library (1 items) 1 Natl Inst for Rsrch&Digtal Transfrm (22 items) 22 NIAR Institute (66 items) 66 Office Ind & Defense Administration (9 items) 9 Office of Research (College) (2 items) 2 Physical Plant (7 items) 7 Strategic Communications (1 items) 1 Strategic Engagement & Planning (23 items) 23 Strategic Enrollment (1 items) 1 Strategic Enrollment Mgmt (6 items) 6 Student Affairs (College) (6 items) 6 Women's Sports/Activities (2 items) 2 WSU Police Department (3 items) 3 Search by job title, location, department, category, etc. Search Sort by: Last Updated Last Updated: Newest to Oldest Last Updated: Oldest to Newest Title: A-Z Title: Z-A Contracts and Grants Specialist - Office of Research 498962 Wichita Staff Office of Research (College) Wichita State University’s Office of Research is seeking a full-time Pre-Award Specialist to support the development, review, and submission of grant and contract proposals. This on-site role manages multiple projects in a deadline-driven environment and ensures all applications comply with University, state, federal, and sponsor requirements. The position plays a key part in enabling research and industry partnerships that drive innovation for Wichita, Kansas, and beyond. Read more IDP Information Systems Security Officer 498932 Wichita Staff NIAR Institute The Information Systems Security Officer (ISSO) plays a critical role in securing and maintaining a classified information system supporting a U.S. Federal Government program. Based on-site at Wichita State University’s main campus, this full‑time role is responsible for developing and managing the System Security Package (SSP), ensuring compliance with Federal and DoD cybersecurity requirements, and supporting the Authorization to Operate (ATO) lifecycle. The ISSO collaborates closely with internal teams and government partners to implement security controls, conduct system assessments, and ensure the protection and proper handling of classified information. This position requires eligibility under U.S. export control laws and the ability to obtain and maintain a U.S. Government security clearance. Read more NIAR CONSULTANT - Computational Fluid Dynamics (CFD) Engineer 498922 Aviation NIAR Institute This position will be an independent contractor consulting as a Computational Fluid \nDynamics (CFD) Engineer with NIAR to support various diverse customer programs. NIAR is looking for a talented Computational Fluid Dynamics (CFD) Engineer to join our growing, innovative computational aerodynamics team. This position will be an independent contractor consulting as a Computational Fluid Dynamics (CFD) Engineer to support various diverse customer program efforts. Read more NIAR CONSULTANT - Thermal Analysis Engineer 498921 Aviation Temporary NIAR Institute NIAR is looking for a talented Thermal Analysis Engineer to join our growing, innovative computational aerodynamics team. This position will be an independent contractor consulting as a Thermal Analysis Engineer to support various diverse customer program efforts. Read more NIAR CNC Machinist I - Composites 498898 Wichita Aviation Staff NIAR Institute The National Institute for Aviation Research (NIAR) is a fast-growing area within WSU, known globally for our expertise in the most critical areas of aerospace research and development. NIAR Composites and Structures is looking for a CNC Machinist to join our team! Read more Engineering Design Checker 495586 Wichita Temporary NIAR Institute Independently compares and verifies that 3D models are complete and accurate representations of 2D data packages. Develops and recommends solutions to design problems. Read more NIAR CNC Programmer - AMP Lab 498491 Wichita Aviation Staff NIAR Institute The National Institute for Aviation Research (NIAR) at Wichita State University is looking for an experienced CNC Programmer. This position is located at the Advanced Machining and Prototyping (AMP) lab in Park City, KS.  Come join our fast-paced and fast-growing team! Read more NIAR Dimensional Metrologist II - CMM Programmer 498492 Wichita Aviation Staff NIAR Institute The National Institute for Aviation Research (NIAR) at Wichita State University is looking for an experienced CMM Programmer. This position is located at the Advanced Machining and Prototyping (AMP) lab in Park City, KS.  Come join our fast-paced and fast-growing team! Read more Graduate Student Assistant – Digitization and Institutional Repository Projects 498849 Wichita Student Library A Graduate Staff Assistant (GSA) assistants university service and academic units in either non-teaching or non-research activities. Specific duties of the GSA vary widely, depending on the administrative or academic unit to which they are assigned, but should be at a level to make use of their education and abilities. Read more WSU Temp - Hourly 498851 Wichita Temporary College of Health Professions Pathway Fundamentals Lab Read more Student Assistant - Work Study 498741 Wichita Student Strategic Enrollment Mgmt A student assistant will carry out administrative and technical tasks requested by a supervisor. Depending on the area the student assistant is employed in, they may assist and mentor other students or provide support throughout the campus in various forms. Read more IDP Information Assurance and Security Engineer 498842 Wichita Staff Natl Inst for Rsrch&Digtal Transfrm We are seeking a self-driven, highly motivated, hands-on IT Security Engineer to serve as a subject-matter expert (SME)/technical lead on our cybersecurity operations team. This individual contributor role focuses on operational excellence and maturity for different cyber operations processes, automation alignment, internal audit readiness (e.g., internal & external audits, including CMMC), and mentorship. The SME will work on-site at Textron, collaborating with junior staff, student contractors, and technical teams, while interfacing with non-IT stakeholders to support secure, scalable cybersecurity operations. Read more F45 Instructor 498728 Wichita Student Student Affairs (College) A student assistant will carry out administrative and technical tasks requested by a supervisor. Depending on the area the student assistant is employed in, they may assist and mentor other students or provide support throughout the campus in various forms. Read more Regional Coordinator - Kansas City 498024 Wichita Academic/Student Support Staff Strategic Engagement & Planning Ahhh the life, Football, Baseball, BBQ Kansas City life, Kansas City Lights! Big picture! Do you believe that every student deserves an exciting future to see their big picture?  Can you see yourself guiding and mentoring staff so they can help these students meet their college dreams?  \nIf your passion is to help youths, in the foster care system, see a future they always wanted & assist them to make it happen, read on as we are eagerly looking for you! Kansas Kids @ GEAR UP is a state-wide program serving students in foster care, grades 7-12 and first year in college. \nThis person must be organized with exceptional time management skills. Plan events /information workshops in the evening or weekends for youths as well as meeting with them regularly during the school day. Travel to kids across the region assisting with personalized services for their scholarly level. Being able to build rapport with this population & maintaining appropriate boundaries is key to these relationships. \nGreat documentation & information sharing with other invested parties is a must! You will provide supervision to staff, coaching and mentoring them to success. Freedom to customize content of events planned & personalize to their needs allows you to show your investment in their future.  If you love to travel, then this position is for you. You will cover The Kansas City area all the while having time to mentally prepare on your way to your appointments.\n\nKansas City is the place you need have your feet planted to be ready for Lights, Camera, Action! Read more Integra Failure Analyst Student Assistant 497937 Wichita Student Natl Inst for Rsrch&Digtal Transfrm Ennovar is looking for a student assistant to work at Intergra. Read more Boeing Production Kitter Student Assistant 495472 Wichita Student Natl Inst for Rsrch&Digtal Transfrm This position with Ennovar will be working onsite for Boeing. The project is focused on designing and implementing standard fastener kits. Standardized kitting of these fasteners and washers promotes a lean manufacturing process, while also providing better visual work instructions to assist newer mechanics when building parts. This position will support the shop by filling kits with fasteners and washers for daily production demand. The position offers flexible work hours.” Read more Student Assistant WSU 498758 Wichita Student Cohens Honors College A student assistant will carry out administrative and technical tasks requested by a supervisor. Depending on the area the student assistant is employed in, they may assist and mentor other students or provide support throughout the campus in various forms. Read more Student Assistant WSU 498772 Wichita Student Strategic Enrollment Mgmt A student assistant will carry out administrative and technical tasks requested by a supervisor. Depending on the area the student assistant is employed in, they may assist and mentor other students or provide support throughout the campus in various forms. Read more Athletics General Ticketing/Development Staff 498732 Wichita Student Administrative and Support Wichita State athletics is searching for professional, service-focused individuals for our ticketing/development team. We deliver memorable experiences that connect all to Shocker Nation through a shared sense of pride and passion. Ticketing/development staff is responsible for providing high-level customer service to WSU Athletics stakeholders while executing day-to-day functions of intercollegiate athletics revenue generation practices. Read more WSU General Student Ticketing/Development Staff 498707 Wichita Athletics Student Administrative and Support A student assistant will carry out administrative and technical tasks requested by a supervisor. Depending on the area the student assistant is employed in, they may assist and mentor other students or provide support throughout the campus in various forms. Read more Advanced Materials Assistant 498747 Wichita Temporary NIAR Institute The Advanced Materials Research group is looking for an assistant interested in pursuing an engineering (or related field) degree. This position will be based in Wichita, KS and will see you work closely with engineers at NIAR to support our growing government and industry customer base. If you are detail oriented, enjoy challenging and rewarding work, and like being part of a team, consider applying for this position. Read more Coordinator - Wichita GEAR UP 498179 Wichita Academic/Student Support Staff Strategic Engagement & Planning Do you believe every young person deserves a shot at the future they dream of? Are you the kind of leader who can turn “what if” into “what’s next”? If so, this is your moment.\nWichita GEAR UP is a program serving students grades 6-12 and first year in college. Multiple positions available at multiple school locations within Wichita. Read more Ennovar General Application 496632 Wichita Student Temporary Natl Inst for Rsrch&Digtal Transfrm Ennovar at Wichita State University has designed an employment model that meets partner needs and enhances the learning process for student employees by integrating education and employment. Read more NIAR Engineering Program Manager 498668 Wichita Aviation Staff NIAR Institute Wichita State University is looking for an experienced Program Manager to join our NIAR Engineering Design Modification (EDM) Team. The ideal candidate will have a good understanding of engineering design, analysis, and aircraft certification. This role will support both commercial and military programs. Read more Structural Analysis Student Assistant 497872 Wichita Student NIAR Institute The NIAR Engineering Design and Mod team is looking for a student assistant to support various diverse program efforts as a structural analysis student assistant. Read more IDP Information Assurance & Junior Security Engineer - Ennovar 498635 Wichita Information Technology Staff Natl Inst for Rsrch&Digtal Transfrm This cross functional role requires coordination with technical managers, system administrators, application owners, software developers, infrastructure, service delivery, and IT management to monitor and control company networks. Collaboration with corporate security and infrastructure and networking teams worldwide is key for this role. The is a WSU position in partnership with, and work location at, Textron Aviation in Wichita, KS. Read more Student Assistant WSU 498625 Wichita Student Strategic Engagement & Planning A student assistant will carry out administrative and technical tasks requested by a supervisor. Depending on the area the student assistant is employed in, they may assist and mentor other students or provide support throughout the campus in various forms. Read more NIAR ATLAS AFP Student Assistant 498449 Wichita Student NIAR Institute The NIAR ATLAS lab is looking for a student assistant. Read more NDI Technician Level I - NIAR ATLAS 498253 Wichita Staff NIAR Institute ATLAS – the Advanced Technologies Lab for Aerospace Systems – is a multi-disciplinary manufacturing environment and engineering education program to prepare engineers and educators for the Factory of the Future and to aid the current workforce in seamlessly adapting to advancements in the workplace. We are seeking an NDI Technician Level I to join our team. Read more Full Scale Instrumentation Student Assistant 498260 Wichita Student NIAR Institute The NIAR Full Scale Structural Test lab is looking for a student assistant. Read more Displaying 151 - 180 of 197 in total ‹ 1 2 3 4 5 6 7 › 1845 Fairmount St. Wichita , Kansas 67260 USA (316) 978-3456 Request Info Visit Apply Contact Us Virtual Tour Campus Map and Directions Facebook X | Twitter Instagram YouTube Linkedin People at Wichita State will make introductions, look for (applied learning) opportunities, and give advice that will put you miles ahead of others. Jon Peterson , senior in business administration and real estate finance Alumni & Friends Give to WSU A-Z Index Freedom of Expression Policies and Procedures Privacy Policy Notice of Nondiscrimination Title IX Campus Safety Accessibility Public Information Website Support KBOR Freedom of Expression Statement HLC Accreditation © 2024 Wichita State University Wichita State University (\"WSU\") does not discriminate on the basis of sex in its education programs, activities, admissions and employment. Candidate Details We use \"cookies\" on this site. A cookie is a piece of data stored on a site visitor's hard drive to help us improve your access to our site and identify repeat visitors to our site. For instance, when we use a cookie to identify you, you would not have to log in a password more than once, thereby saving time while on our site. Cookies can also enable us to track and target the interests of our users to enhance the experience on our site. Usage of a cookie is in no way linked to any personally identifiable information on our site. Some of our business partners may use cookies on our site (for example, Google Analytics). However, we have no access to or control over these cookies. I do not accept I accept"
