23 items) 23 Strategic Enrollment (1 items) 1 Strategic Enrollment Mgmt (6 items) 6 Student Affairs (College) (6 items) 6 Women's Sports/Activities (2 items) 2 WSU Police Department (3 items) 3 Search by job title, location, department, category, etc. Search Sort by: Last Updated Last Updated: Newest to Oldest Last Updated: Oldest to Newest Title: A-Z Title: Z-A IDP Project Manager - NIAR Advanced Materials Research 498561 Wichita Aviation Staff NIAR Institute The ideal candidate for the project manager position will have experience in communicating and planning all aspects of programs, including budgets, resource allocations, timelines, and team dynamics. Strong time management and meticulous attention to detail are essential, along with the ability to utilize metrics to foresee and mitigate potential issues. Read more NIAR Avionics Technician - 2nd Shift 498382 Wichita Aviation Staff NIAR Institute In a hangar adjacent to McConnell AFB that once housed Boeing Air Force One modification facilities, the MRO team at NIAR provides production design, initial and Supplemental Type Certification, instrumentation installation, modifications and field support/repair. We are looking for Avionics Technicians to join our team! Read more NIAR CONSULTANT - Senior Design Engineer- Structures 498555 Aviation Temporary NIAR Institute Since its inception in 1985, National Institute for Aviation Research (NIAR) at Wichita State University has made a name for itself as the most capable university-based aviation research center in the United States, providing research, design, testing, certification and training to the aviation manufacturing industry, government agencies, educational entities and other clients that can benefit from our services.\nNIAR is looking for a talented Senior Systems Design Engineer- Structures to support diverse customer programs. Read more NIAR CONSULTANT - Senior Mechanical Systems Engineer 498553 Aviation Temporary NIAR Institute NIAR is looking for a talented Senior Mechanical Systems Engineer to join our growing, innovative team. This position will be an independent contractor with NIAR to support various diverse customer programs. Read more NIAR CONSULTANT - Senior Stress Engineer 498550 Aviation Temporary NIAR Institute This position will be an independent contractor consulting as a Stress Engineer with NIAR to support various diverse customer programs. This person will complete tasks that may include preliminary sizing, development of load paths, detailed analysis, certification and documentation required to support program objectives. Experience in both metallic and composite analysis is desired. Some travel may be required. Read more NIAR CONSULTANT - Stress Engineer 498551 Aviation Temporary NIAR Institute This position will be an independent contractor consulting as a Stress Engineer with NIAR to support various diverse customer programs. This person will complete tasks that may include preliminary sizing, development of load paths, detailed analysis, certification and documentation required to support program objectives. Experience in both metallic and composite analysis is desired. Some travel may be required. Read more NIAR CONSULTANT - Senior Fatigue and Damage Tolerance Engineer 498549 Aviation Temporary NIAR Institute NIAR is looking for a talented Design Engineer to join our growing, innovative team. This position will be an independent contractor consulting as a Design Engineer with NIAR to support various diverse customer programs. This person will support design tasks across structural elements, systems installations, and engineering deliverables throughout the product lifecycle. They will execute changes to CAD models, drawings, and other documents in support of the product, participate in trade studies, create and maintain ICDs (interface control documents), and coordinate with customers. Some travel may be required. Read more NIAR CONSULTANT - Design Engineer - Structure and Systems 498547 Aviation Temporary NIAR Institute NIAR is looking for a talented Design Engineer to join our growing, innovative team. This position will be an independent contractor consulting as a Design Engineer with NIAR to support various diverse customer programs. This person will support design tasks across structural elements, systems installations, and engineering deliverables throughout the product lifecycle. They will execute changes to CAD models, drawings, and other documents in support of the product, participate in trade studies, create and maintain ICDs (interface control documents), and coordinate with customers. Some travel may be required. Read more NIAR CONSULTANT - Senior Electrical Systems Engineer 498542 Aviation Temporary NIAR Institute NIAR is looking for a talented Senior Electrical Systems Engineer to join our growing, innovative team. This position will be an independent contractor consulting as a Senior Electrical Systems Engineer with NIAR to support various diverse customer programs. Read more NIAR ATLAS Injection Molding Student Assistant 498452 Wichita Student NIAR Institute The NIAR ATLAS lab is looking for a student assistant. Read more NIAR Composites and Structures Machinist 497115 Wichita Temporary NIAR Institute The NIAR Composites & Structures lab is looking for a machinist. Read more Postdoctoral Researcher 498265 Wichita Staff College of Engineering The Department of Mechanical Engineering at Wichita State University invites applications for a postdoctoral researcher position focusing on the design, synthesis, and characterization of advanced inorganic nanomaterials for wastewater treatment, energy harvest, and environmental engineering-centric applications. This position is part of an NSF-funded program, and the successful candidate is expected to engage in a broad range of research and academic activities supporting the program’s goals Read more College Access Advisor - Wichita GEAR UP 498181 Wichita Academic/Student Support Staff Strategic Engagement & Planning This position is designed for someone who believes that early, intentional intervention can change the trajectory of a student’s life and who’s ready to roll up their sleeves to make that happen. This role sits exactly where impact matters most: face-to-face with students who need guidance, consistency, and someone who won’t give up on them. Wichita GEAR UP is a program serving students in grades 6-12 and first year in college. Multiple positions available at multiple school locations within Wichita. Read more NIAR CAD/CAM Digital Twin Student Assistant 497618 Wichita Student NIAR Institute NIAR’s CAD/CAM lab is looking for students to work with Mechanical CAD and Systems Engineering for various projects in the Digital Twin lab. Students may be required to learn about other software products and hardware. They will support a variety of projects and programs for the lab. Their task may range from classroom support and project research to direct industry program support. Employees will be expected to assist lab staff in any way possible to help make the lab successful, presentable to customers, and accomplish projects in a timely manner. Read more NIAR Research Engineer - High Temperature Composites and Advanced Materials 497493 Wichita Aviation Staff NIAR Institute The National Institute for Aviation Research (NIAR) is a fast-growing area within WSU, known globally for our expertise in the most critical areas of aerospace research and development.\nWork within the NIAR High Temperature Composites and Advanced Materials Group is rapidly expanding. We are looking for someone who thrives while working on applied research projects with a wide range of tasks, including researching and managing projects; analyzing data; writing documents and reports; overseeing material processing and testing activities; and development and implementation of new material processing and testing procedures. Our dynamic, collaborative work environment allows for work to be tailored to fit team members’ skill set and experience. Consider joining our team! Read more NIAR Research Engineer, Senior - High Temperature Composites and Advanced Materials 497492 Wichita Aviation Staff NIAR Institute The National Institute for Aviation Research (NIAR) is a fast-growing area within WSU, known globally for our expertise in the most critical areas of aerospace research and development.\n\nWork within the NIAR High Temperature Composites and Advanced Materials Group is rapidly expanding. We are looking for someone who thrives while working on applied research projects with a wide range of tasks, including researching and managing projects; analyzing data; writing documents and reports; overseeing material processing and testing activities; and development and implementation of new material processing and testing procedures. Our dynamic, collaborative work environment allows for work to be tailored to fit team members’ skill set and experience. Consider joining our team! Read more IDP Program Manager II - Digital Twin and Digital Manufacturing 497292 Wichita Aviation Staff NIAR Institute Wichita State University Industry and Defense Programs is looking for a Program Manager to join our NIAR CAD/CAM (Digital Twin & Digital Manufacturing) Team! The ideal candidate will be experienced and comfortable in communicating, outlining and planning all aspects of work related to a given program such as budget, timelines and teams. They will have strong communication skills that enable them to effectively communicate with all relevant teams. This individual should be able to utilize metrics to foresee any problems related to the completion of a program and act in a timely manner to mitigate any issues, and report it in daily or weekly manner to the Principal Investigator(s) and Senior Management. Research programs will range from moderately complex projects to large highly complex programs with high programmatic risk. Read more Displaying 181 - 197 of 197 in total ‹ 1 2 3 4 5 6 7 › 1845 Fairmount St. Wichita , Kansas 67260 USA (316) 978-3456 Request Info Visit Apply Contact Us Virtual Tour Campus Map and Directions Facebook X | Twitter Instagram YouTube Linkedin People at Wichita State will make introductions, look for (applied learning) opportunities, and give advice that will put you miles ahead of others. Jon Peterson , senior in business administration and real estate finance Alumni & Friends Give to WSU A-Z Index Freedom of Expression Policies and Procedures Privacy Policy Notice of Nondiscrimination Title IX Campus Safety Accessibility Public Information Website Support KBOR Freedom of Expression Statement HLC Accreditation © 2024 Wichita State University Wichita State University (\"WSU\") does not discriminate on the basis of sex in its education programs, activities, admissions and employment. Candidate Details We use \"cookies\" on this site. A cookie is a piece of data stored on a site visitor's hard drive to help us improve your access to our site and identify repeat visitors to our site. For instance, when we use a cookie to identify you, you would not have to log in a password more than once, thereby saving time while on our site. Cookies can also enable us to track and target the interests of our users to enhance the experience on our site. Usage of a cookie is in no way linked to any personally identifiable information on our site. Some of our business partners may use cookies on our site (for example, Google Analytics). However, we have no access to or control over these cookies. I do not accept I accept"
